# `just fmt` runs `prettier --write .` over the whole repository. Helm
# templates are Go templates that happen to have a `.yaml` extension: a line
# like `{{- include "vpay.validate" . -}}` is not YAML, prettier's YAML parser
# rejects it, and anything it did manage to reformat would break the
# indentation the templates depend on. `helm lint` is the formatter for this
# directory.
deploy/helm/**/templates/
